<title>LITHUANIA: SNAIGE REPORTS PROFIT IN 7 MONTHS.</title>
<headline>SNAIGE REPORTS PROFIT IN 7 MONTHS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					  (amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Net profit			455,555  vs losses 1.0</p>
<p>    Sales			     83.2     vs	 86.2</p>
<p>Notes: Fridge producer Snaige reorted 2.047 million litas</p>
<p>losses and 63.6 million litas turnover in the first half of</p>
<p>1997.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
